{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02698","headline":"游侠篇 · 陈子良","name":"游侠篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛阳丽春色，游侠骋轻肥。\n水逐车轮转，尘随马足飞。\n云影遥临盖，花气近薰衣。\n东郊鬬鸡罢，南皮射雉归。\n日暮河桥上，扬鞭惜晚晖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子良","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02698.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02698","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}